                </a> <a href="javascript:;" class="btns buy-btn">
                    整本购
                    <!----></a> <a href="javascript:void(0);" class="follow btns"><img src="data:image/png;base64,">
                    关注
                </a></div></div></div></div></div> <div style="display: flex"><div class="left"><div class="TopicEpisode"><div class="topic-episode" data-v-9e4ca722><div class="text-warp" data-v-9e4ca722><div class="title" data-v-9e4ca722>章节列表</div> <div class="detail" data-v-9e4ca722>已完结</div> <span class="line" style="display:;" data-v-9e4ca722></span> <div class="detail" style="display:;" data-v-9e4ca722>
            共100个内容
        </div> <span class="line" data-v-9e4ca722></span> <div class="detail" style="display:;" data-v-9e4ca722>
            共100篇正文
        </div></div> <div class="episode-interval" data-v-9e4ca722></div> <div class="episode-title" data-v-9e4ca722></div></div></div> <div class="TopicComment"><div class="topic-comment" data-v-31e4863f><div class="title" data-v-31e4863f>热门评论</div> <div class="comment-list" style="height:573px;" data-v-31e4863f><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/default_avatar_image.jpg-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>快x新</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-05-26</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>336</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>谁来跟我解释一下破坏之神和生命女神去哪了，他们留下的种子又是什么</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FnrnJ7iQpC5dslmf0B9JYqj-gKKU-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>覆洲</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>27</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>相对于原漫画，我觉得唐三的脸型变了，还有作者你一开头就撒狗粮真的好吗</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FryeWGE9o1RIL6XbH93iOfgZiLuA-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>惜_桐</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>46</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>呜，感觉跟神界传说比起来，舞桐的头发潦草了很多，但是依旧很好看呢。不过，没想到快看里面有唐门英雄传，找了好多都没找到呢</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/Fp6XWbP4GsyPwKlkpd_d1IGcxOYW-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>小樱殿</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>14</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>这一篇明显是赶出来的，错字和漏字很多，希望下次可以注意。还有海神的蓝发怎么变黑了？额头上的三叉戟图案呢？</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FqAzcARdXA9nY5Zi4l-ABfRWRcQ0-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>漠九三生</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-04</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>9</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>三少最近超级多作品都在快看上面有漫画，还超级精致诶！我觉得可能跟神界传说画风稍微差了一点吧，但也很好看</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FjAYhyz_t3ldtaT855i4Vasr69z9-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>在下薯片小姐_</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>5</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>大长粗啊啊啊赞爆啊画风还是和以前一样好呢从小学就开始追斗罗大陆了神界能把那么多小说主角串联一起真是太厉害了本来想着一月一更是不是太少了但一话都量足啊💚❤️</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/Fjjs4x3s3uC72VaX6sUfqyUWT51_-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>苏清SQ</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-06-29</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>93</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>好多三少其他的作品都集中到斗罗了，比如周维清《天珠变》，烈焰，姬动《酒神》</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FkRc39lRmcOqAvdBwg5OipQStUVm-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>忘机--无羡</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>15</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>我超喜欢这个《斗罗大陆》，不过另外我告诉你在其他App已经更新了很多篇了。</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FjZU7iiKb5u02BnSH39OumL8WEgY-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>顾辞兮夜</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-07</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>42</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>作者大大画的不错，就是要改一下颜色，让这个更接近于上一个漫画</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FkwVsoQIA4vAwduModuyDYCTu-6z-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>创世神光-</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>2</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>为什么神界中枢防卫系统叫宙斯之盾？</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FlvNBQMk95zkkGYfiT5sb_d9dJn0-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>繁华如梦静似雪</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-04</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>说实话，虽然知道小舞身为人母心疼儿子，可小三也身为人父啊，不仅如此小三还是神王，要主持神界，心疼三哥</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/image/170518/Q3wUHUYu3.webp-w180.w.jpg" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>别忘__vyl</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2020-02-07</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>50</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>我想知道周围青是什么时候成为破坏神的</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/lmE90XTS84v83sekrPEcf5Vchcs--w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>黄金蛋糕_U44rUn</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2020-06-05</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>38</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>hi正在看斗罗的朋友们，我又回来英雄传看霍雨浩啦</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FkCjDOKaQaAa6ad71Z9GYStoWfIY-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>Qstaly</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>2</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>除了斗罗大陆的第二三部在哪里可以看到</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/Fr8PA_bsdNAwnrJtgNnCtPlIpwZG-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>Ldh17</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-07-12</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>49</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>霍雨浩没有以前几部画的时候画的样子好看了。</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FoABSYOgf-TaBQ-5TUHrx__QBEHl-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>一身白衣-一生栽</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-19</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>66</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>为什么那唐梧桐蝴蝶翅膀要放在脑袋上</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/Fn9DvIy7uMrYfK6fltE_UPp4octD-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>初西的月光</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-06</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>25</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>雨浩不会是唐三和小舞的儿子吧，看起来好像</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FjfqgKSqPeGe106RwDGUes5Vm8_8-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>寒灬宸</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-04</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>5</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>感觉有的地方没以前精致了……最近绝世唐门的漫画也是这样，好多地方脸崩了……希望可以有所改观</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FrAuPmg01G7wLBU7UqJX5jn6Ra8e-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>漫威迷729号</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>2</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>还是挺喜欢画风的 不过感觉比原来差了一点</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/Fm_r2XT0N8IFs4XgpkYeyz0jYOw0-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>胡蝶不是蝴蝶</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>2</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>别问了，唐昊是斗罗位面之主，阿银是黄金古树，后来在深渊位面入侵的时候，唐昊一锤子砸死了深渊圣君</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FhB6xW61XXevWp7nGI6g_5mEmmk9-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>幽夜月羽</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>终于出了，我期待了很久终于出了，唐三和小舞画的好好看啊，但是其他人物头发颜色和脸部还不是很好看，希望画者多加改进</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FuEWl1pYd_sdu4cM7Ko5Ras0wPU--w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>倾沧海</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-16</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>42</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>QQ看点的唐三都去拜访神界墓地了，快看的小舞还在心悸[滑稽护体]</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/image/171111/YLqGgBhbz.webp-w180.w.jpg" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>moomyl</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>32</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>小学就在看斗罗系列，现在都高二了还再看，这是真的深爱啊</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/default_avatar_image.jpg-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>二了解</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2020-01-22</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>14</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>喇叭了解我在看你自己来啊我们俩月经期间</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/Fpk-ISFa3jK3btmKM-eSe1t6paPh-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>社会复杂爷简单1</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2022-03-30</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>0</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>情绪之神让我想起国漫冰火魔厨的融念冰了</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/image/170813/T7JCThQ3x.webp-w180.w.jpg" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>西瓜的茶桑</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>2</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>其实要看这个的话，建议先去看神界传说</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/Fn91wg_scje3BviG67BVqR-DAI2Z-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>优优__hit</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-08-21</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>这发际线都遮住半个额头了</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FoP6SmgMuBnKvZd1_g16TSrdlej6-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>舞桐-_-呀</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-04-20</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>姬动和烈焰怎么跑这里来了</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/image/170202/k7m4i9yzt.webp-w180.w.jpg" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>入道小寒64</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-03-31</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>暴君李解冻，可能是三少的偶像吧</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FizwkXJfu25BJNJaC8Y5i5rBPzYo-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>川川猪</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>2</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>这画风很好，要看懂这部漫画必须得看完斗罗大陆所有。</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FhxK1V87_kqMQZKc0WUH3wYKrjTC-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>惠安行</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-04-30</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>199</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>从小看的斗罗大陆。
这画面时不时就简陋，真的对这个漫画负责了吗对斗罗大陆这个名字？并不是只要闪，一两幅精细就好的吧？对快看作品质量审核失望了。不能因为它是大ip就这样吧！</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FgxJ6s63seMR9amDH0Tj3f1gEs3l-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>j至尊</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-04-06</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>10</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>这感觉已经脱离了原来漫画的，人物背景</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FrOGAUzOA8L4bZiwyJrLkjDpLkDs-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>一鹿晗者棒棒糖</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-06</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>这是外传的续集吗？唐三头发变不好看了</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/Fm8TpVHW1uSZIZn57OaGY_li7rey-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>云中仙鹤_i</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-10-06</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>88</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>唐门英雄传没有史莱克七怪的戏份嘛？😂</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/image/170927/ZYhMydipn.webp-w180.w.jpg" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>字体管家123</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-06-23</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>44</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>说真的，30年早过了，为什么念融冰还不走啊</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/Fg8N08zhK4lCvGArnuKj3rut2SYU-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>莫澜汐</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>12</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>感觉唐三没有以前年轻啦，终于有做爸爸的感觉了。我的男神，这么快你就成爷爷啦。哎～</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/Fg4UIHVfHMseA59t2u3JvAyV8tKp-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>羡羡永远爱忘机</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2020-07-31</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>4</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>这部漫画是由斗罗大陆、光之子、酒神、空速星痕而合并起来的，这里的每一部漫画的主人工都是从不起眼到现在，现在他们都成了最起眼的神了，还是最受人尊重的神了。</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/image/171031/86uzpFhb1.webp-w180.w.jpg" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>时___hod</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-11</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>这个唐三没有神界传说里的帅T^T</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FsLrClhshL1J83RsA8rtzbgycUua-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>静静_611</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>好像来错了地方…这里貌似都是资深人士……（小声BB）</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/image/180823/wwzH4DV6q.webp-w180.w.jpg" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>微風清熙</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>我现在乱了，念冰不是别的世界吗？</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FuTnaddkllZsimduYpLzxPRN0Dw5-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>堇阳</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2023-08-13</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>0</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>我想看的是绝世唐门，怎么跑到番外了？[热词_破防了]</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/default_avatar_image.jpg-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>巧克力島國之一</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2020-04-25</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>24</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>為什麼絶世唐门不播完就到三了</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FprHSPRpLeJcavdQ7kGrb6w3t965-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>初凛兔酱</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-04</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>2</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>看过一点小说后面的剧情，大概就是这么发展的，神器在初步稳定一下之后不要怎么着的又崩溃了，然后呢之后着急哥哥神界的人过来一起修复，大概有死神阿呆，然后琴帝；剑帝，唐三；还有其他神界的各个神王🌚（因为我懒，懒得写还有谁）🌝不过想表明那个青帝怎么那么花痴哦？</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FsW6NXRHHyW6_L-M28iLaygXiMrs-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>模糊_2VA7co</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>2</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>画风还是比神界传说粗糙了不少</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/default_avatar_image.jpg-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>宋鸿煊</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>2</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>后来他们会和其它七个神界争夺七星阵</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FvYQcqbUW6jdLYrdLwL1xqbEv3Ed-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>凌冰幻殇</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-08</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>为虾米霍雨浩就出现了那么一点</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FmHjxjw-lLt6waIRfr-nlMu98-lS-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>我怀念的只是</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-04</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>黄金三叉戟不见了，作者以后要画上去</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FuqXrvEUnu9BOle8XPuMzC4TJcwC-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>桜_夢</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>画风和神界传说来比还是差了点</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FgIPn9q6iM-uh1TnnYQI70sjJw7L-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>伊墨沈</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2021-04-02</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>什么时候又增加了？我记得我上次看的时候都已经完结了，谁知道还有？</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/lm0CE9Q05O_RNytHhCFljxPF6QYT-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>zhushuai123</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-07-04</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>花了多少时间啊？</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FgDAn1y4O3Rd0KGrtUYz36TPP6u9-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>月兮喜欢玺</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>479</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>小舞真是越来越美了呢，舞桐还是一样的绝世容颜❤虽然是不同的画风，但也非常好看！作者快更，期待期待！！【给作者比心💓】</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FhRRowqa_hQawxY314_PXj4trFly-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>调皮__xn</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-04-14</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>190</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>我纠正一下各位，唐舞桐是光蝶和三哥生的，不是小舞的孩子，那只是三哥犯下的错，后来小舞原谅了他</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FtQhesBn2pCLpDV-T1dfefq6fmxn-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>汐与</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-17</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>162</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>为什么没有以前画的好看了，三哥的蓝发去哪了，雨浩画的也不是很好</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/Fox1E7Y9LsfLl0mUibny6UbeUWPm-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>PbqJJa</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-08-18</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>46</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>有谁告诉我《斗罗大陆》有几季？小舞和唐三是啥时候结的婚呢？哎呦，心酸。😰😰😰</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FvHI83Vrjcq76elFj-9EFj-tVBja-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>龙封猫缘</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-06</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>4</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>还是喜欢看舞麟和古月的虐狗事件。</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/image/180421/iC4p3VFl4.webp-w180.w.jpg" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>淅___470</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," cla