63f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>终于等到第二部了</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/image/200314/pSbaI8JRb.webp-w180.w.jpg" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>行者__C88fNs</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2020-03-31</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>我看了好多版的《斗罗大陆》这一版没看</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FooXWuJz05cJZhK71GSfst_ZKcsq-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>默然痕然</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>19</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>我挺铁的斗罗迷，斗罗一，斗罗二，斗罗三，最近斗罗四出了，我也是抢着买的，神界传说，唐门英雄传我也买了，反正超喜欢三少的作品呢（和我一样的点赞）</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FqGGrIlfGiNoPfRiqlHRj9NWGo4a-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>南城旧梦源</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>都没看过神界传说？</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FtkhuFxJFYRSrGc-xAKwr4YeHNvX-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>繁花丶回忆</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>唐舞麟在斗罗大陆上的父母是爷爷奶奶？？？？</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/image/190816/IgeeatKJn.webp-w180.w.jpg" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>繁荣__5fWOew</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2020-04-10</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>7</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>小舞真的很思念她的儿子，不知道唐舞麟和小舞这对母子何时重逢啊，呜呜呜😭😭😫</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/default_avatar_image.jpg-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>一寸灰_567</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2020-02-11</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>师娘你耳朵好大啊！</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FhrT-n7O6b_bYWC1yuiKCyFzbckF-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>龍夢飛</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-08-07</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>唐三牛B了！他这么牛！他家人知道吗？</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FvAzMc7rSMx3FsobAl_GeLlTpISd-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>RoseRsy</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-07-14</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>大大已经画很好了，加油</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FtlF9qorZcde_5f_r3sWpIjqBxlK-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>安诺沐雪</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>画风好好！！！但是好多错别字...（小说看完的我实在是太期待漫画了！）</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FsLrClhshL1J83RsA8rtzbgycUua-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>静静_611</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>2</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>大家也可以去支持唐大大的，斗罗大陆2绝世唐门，斗罗大陆3龙王传说，斗罗大陆外传神界传说，都很好看呢，个人还是比较喜欢绝世唐门啦～</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/image/180722/5hT8Y03ab.webp-w180.w.jpg" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>铝孩纸_797</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>我一定要追……谁让我小说没仔细看……</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FkxWkAq0Wn1w4PlvJ6bZD-6C01OW-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>优鱼吖</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>小舞越來越好看了吧</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/image/170221/4k0ncpdo9.webp-w180.w.jpg" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>杏子微酸</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-02-03</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>很好看，钟爱斗罗系列！</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/image/200528/iSrRC0MBU.webp-w180.w.jpg" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>星空之梦_Or0dcJ</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2020-12-30</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>你儿子正在大战，你问我</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/Fgu_Ih0UfdR3562akrpm61gO7H4k-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>劳资名叫江晚吟</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-04-14</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>115</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>其实能不要吐槽大大的画风吗，我觉得挺好的，(本人不喜欢太过于华丽的画风)，大大画的也很辛苦的，再说这是三少请的人，能有多差</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FiZaDLR4IvYf0geDYbgGiV_A6All-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>九狐久囧</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-04-14</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>48</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>但不免说王冬是唐舞麟弟的，等一下。王冬就是唐舞麟。唐舞麟的弟弟是那个第3季龙王传说的那个主角。名字什么我也忘了。看不懂的可以去看 番外神剑传说。</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FoIlNpcKETcKpTUysTdHJIsWUzeq-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>灵岚小仙女</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-04-14</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>18</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>＋一个
唐门⑤出了，他们应该是娜儿和唐乐天（好像是）唐舞麟和古月（抱歉我还是习惯叫古月）失忆了，在冰里面又生了个孩子？？！（好像是</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FvRRJGLLWwiGUJVoiQ1nJoerVDCG-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>缘笙_skr</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-04-14</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>3</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>那啥 大大 能不能加几个戴老大和竹清的镜头 超站这对cp！！！</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/image/171208/c76V0z1n3.webp-w180.w.jpg" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>小舞月</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-04-14</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>17</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>我很喜欢斗罗大陆，但是太久没看了，感觉有一种陌生感。</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/image/180617/LQCKEjphZ.webp-w180.w.jpg" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>洛水__神赋</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-04-14</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>21</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>还可以啊，但是没有神界传说画风好看，虽然构图很想，但细节上还是不行(▼皿▼#)</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/image/190125/wzfgneCch.webp-w180.w.jpg" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>pink三三</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-04-14</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>4</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>我同学有这本漫画书是12,13册的          这本书都出了好几册了</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/default_avatar_image.jpg-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>KK世界居民_jvHOw2</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-06-11</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>4</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>绝世唐门里面是不是有一个人叫王冬？</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/FuDFQ35-f1WyvDiConT-Thc0DFpZ-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>X黎黎x</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-07-22</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>0</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>又谁和我一样是看电视后来的吗</div></div><div class="comment-item" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-info" data-v-31e4863f><img src="https://f2.kkmh.com/default_avatar_image.jpg-w180" class="avatar" data-v-31e4863f> <div class="center" data-v-31e4863f><div class="user-name" data-v-31e4863f>圣雪灵姑</div> <div class="date" data-v-31e4863f>2019-07-19</div></div> <div class="right" data-v-31e4863f><img src="data:image/png;base64," class="like" data-v-31e4863f> <span class="like-count" data-v-31e4863f>1</span></div></div> <div class="content" data-v-31e4863f>唐梧桐小姐姐。好漂亮啊😘🌹</div></div><div class