83326,created_at_info:"2019-05-26 23:08",content_type:d},{id:"709475240936306848",content:"相对于原漫画，我觉得唐三的脸型变了，还有作者你一开头就撒狗粮真的好吗",favbury:a,floor:a,user:{grade:a,nickname:"覆洲",id:113082270,userTagList:[],pub_feed:a,avatar_url:jb,avatar_url_jpg:jb,reg_type:n,user_role:a,user_role_mark:a,vip_type:a,head_charm_id:2219,head_charm_url:"https:\u002F\u002Ff1.kkmh.com\u002F21d0a3ff70fe98631ecdd4842073fac31731064139459",dynamic_head_charm_url:c,vip_icon:c,nameplate_id:a,nameplate_image:c,reward_honour_title:c,reward_extra:{reward_title_color:c,reward_bg_color:c}},source:a,best:b,liked:b,sticky:b,comicAuthor:b,likes_count_info:"27",target_type:a,comic_id:g,comment_type:a,replied_comment_id:f,replied_user_id:a,likes_count:27,is_liked:b,is_comic_author:b,is_best:b,is_sticky:b,created_at:1549167147,created_at_info:"2019-02-03 12:12",content_type:d},{id:"709420263811414032",content:"呜，感觉跟神界传说比起来，舞桐的头发潦草了很多，但是依旧很好看呢。不过，没想到快看里面有唐门英雄传，找了好多都没找到呢",favbury:a,floor:a,user:{grade:a,nickname:"惜_桐",id:101094149,userTagList:[],pub_feed:a,avatar_url:jc,avatar_url_jpg:jc,reg_type:m,user_role:a,user_role_mark:a,vip_type:a,head_charm_id:a,head_charm_url:c,dynamic_head_charm_url:c,vip_icon:c,nameplate_id:a,nameplate_image:c,reward_honour_title:c,reward_extra:{reward_title_color:c,reward_bg_color:c}},source:a,best:b,liked:b,sticky:b,comicAuthor:b,likes_count_info:jd,target_type:a,comic_id:g,comment_type:a,replied_comment_id:f,replied_user_id:a,likes_count:je,is_liked:b,is_comic_author:b,is_best:b,is_sticky:b,created_at:1549160593,created_at_info:"2019-02-03 10:23",content_type:d},{id:"709426521268385904",content:"这一篇明显是赶出来的，错字和漏字很多，希望下次可以注意。还有海神的蓝发怎么变黑了？额头上的三叉戟图案呢？",favbury:a,floor:a,user:{grade:a,nickname:jf,id:jg,userTagList:[],pub_feed:a,avatar_url:G,avatar_url_jpg:G,reg_type:n,user_role:a,user_role_mark:a,vip_type:d,head_charm_id:jh,head_charm_url:ji,dynamic_head_charm_url:c,vip_icon:jj,nameplate_id:a,nameplate_image:c,reward_honour_title:c,reward_extra:{reward_title_color:c,reward_bg_color:c}},