 12:28",content_type:d},{id:"1003082912015416336",content:"还是喜欢史莱克七怪",favbury:a,floor:a,user:{grade:a,nickname:"星天白",id:28218239,userTagList:[],pub_feed:a,avatar_url:kY,avatar_url_jpg:kY,reg_type:j,user_role:a,user_role_mark:a,vip_type:a,head_charm_id:a,head_charm_url:c,dynamic_head_charm_url:c,vip_icon:c,nameplate_id:a,nameplate_image:c,reward_honour_title:c,reward_extra:{reward_title_color:c,reward_bg_color:c}},source:a,liked:b,sticky:b,best:b,comicAuthor:b,likes_count_info:kZ,target_type:a,comic_id:g,comment_type:a,replied_comment_id:f,replied_user_id:a,likes_count:X,is_liked:b,is_comic_author:b,is_best:b,is_sticky:b,created_at:1584167909,created_at_info:"2020-03-14 14:38",content_type:d},{id:"709858198532749408",content:"然后就是…为啥念冰大哥跑到这个世界来了ಠ_ಠ我就一直很纳闷这个问题，而且《冰火魔厨》有没有结局，我到现在也没看见，还有，不是说儿子随爹吗，为啥小舞麟和他爹一点儿也不想，反而越来越像舞长空了，这是怎么回事!?(･_･;?，不过，小舞麟的儿子倒是和他小时候一模一样，那么可爱能吃～希望他们一家子能尽快团聚，还有就是希望唐家三少家里别再出这么多意外了，弄的人家伤心死了",favbury:a,floor:r,user:{grade:a,nickname:"梦里云柯",id:126236798,userTagList:[],pub_feed:a,avatar_url:k_,avatar_url_jpg:k_,reg_type:m,user_role:a,user_role_mark:a,vip_type:a,head_charm_id:a,head_charm_url:c,dynamic_head_charm_url:c,vip_icon:c,nameplate_id:a,nameplate_image:c,reward_honour_title:c,reward_extra:{reward_title_color:c,reward_bg_color:c}},source:a,liked:b,sticky:b,best:b,comicAuthor:b,likes_count_info:p,target_type:a,comic_id:g,comment_type:a,replied_comment_id:f,replied_user_id:a,likes_count:o,is_liked:b,is_comic_author:b,is_best:b,is_sticky:b,created_at:1549212799,created_at_info:"2019-02-04 00:53",content_type:d},{id:"709806131743127872",content:"画风好棒，喜欢！但也有美中不足的地方啦，但大大真的好不容易的呢，原著和漫画都很喜欢❤",favbury:a,floor:a,user:{grade:a,nickname:"走起的小喵",id:92094466,userTagList:[],pub_feed:a,avatar_url:k$,avatar_url_jpg:k$,reg_type:m,user_role:a,user_role_mark:a,vip_type:a,head_charm_id:a,head_charm_url:c,dynamic_head_charm_url:c,vip_icon:c,nameplate_id:a,nameplate_image:c,reward_honour_title:c,reward_extra:{reward_title_color:c,reward_bg_color:c}},source:a,liked:b,sticky