,floor:J,user:{grade:a,nickname:"KK世界居民_dIRjN3",id:102401656,userTagList:[],pub_feed:a,avatar_url:q,avatar_url_jpg:q,reg_type:m,user_role:a,user_role_mark:a,vip_type:a,head_charm_id:a,head_charm_url:c,dynamic_head_charm_url:c,vip_icon:c,nameplate_id:a,nameplate_image:c,reward_honour_title:c,reward_extra:{reward_title_color:c,reward_bg_color:c}},source:a,best:b,liked:b,sticky:b,comicAuthor:b,likes_count_info:kh,target_type:a,comic_id:g,comment_type:a,replied_comment_id:f,replied_user_id:a,likes_count:ki,is_liked:b,is_comic_author:b,is_best:b,is_sticky:b,created_at:1550469448,created_at_info:"2019-02-18 13:57",content_type:d},{id:"719920581267519552",content:"现在唐门英雄传画风和神界传说不一样了，那只是因为现在斗罗大陆换主笔画师了，画风自然是不同的，你觉得画丑了你可以自己藏着，如果人家看到这条消息，心里自然不好受，请考虑别人的尊严。\n我知道我的话语很幼稚，但这是我花了很大时间才想出来的。",favbury:a,floor:ks,user:{grade:a,nickname:"江念之_558",id:121217862,userTagList:[],pub_feed:a,avatar_url:nw,avatar_url_jpg:nw,reg_type:j,user_role:a,user_role_mark:a,vip_type:a,head_charm_id:a,head_charm_url:c,dynamic_head_charm_url:c,vip_icon:c,nameplate_id:a,nameplate_image:c,reward_honour_title:c,reward_extra:{reward_title_color:c,reward_bg_color:c}},source:a,best:b,liked:b,sticky:b,comicAuthor:b,likes_count_info:"62",target_type:a,comic_id:g,comment_type:a,replied_comment_id:f,replied_user_id:a,likes_count:62,is_liked:b,is_comic_author:b,is_best:b,is_sticky:b,created_at:1550412329,created_at_info:"2019-02-17 22:05",content_type:d},{id:"719803814906001456",content:"我。。。。咋觉得唐三变丑了。。😂😂😂\n还有周维清，，他不是拒绝到神界吗....难道是我记错了😓😓😓",favbury:a,floor:r,user:{grade:a,nickname:"每天都在考古",id:103278116,userTagList:[],pub_feed:a,avatar_url:nx,avatar_url_jpg:nx,reg_type:j,user_role:a,user_role_mark:a,vip_type:a,head_charm_id:529,head_charm_url:"https:\u002F\u002Ff1.kkmh.com\u002FFpkz-CvXzcXPt-mbxcv63CFNBheM",dynamic_head_charm_url:c,vip_icon:c,nameplate_id:a,nameplate_image:c,reward_honour_title:c,reward_extra:{reward_title_color:c,reward_bg_color:c}},source:a,best:b,liked:b,sticky:b,comicAuthor:b,likes_count_info:V,target_type:a,comic_id:g,comment_type:a,replied_comment_id:f,replied_user_id:a,likes_count:I,is_liked:b,is_comic_author:b,is_best:b,is_sticky:b,created_at:1550398409,created_at_info:"2019-02-17 18:13",content_type:d},{id:"720415196949084288",content:"nono，英雄传是神界外传的后续，故事结局在斗四那也很偏后，正常顺序应该是读三发生的时间和这个斗罗英雄传发生的时间是一样的，而到后面《斗罗大陆》后一块提到了1万年之后，那个1万年之后其实提到的是斗四，也就是说斗萝英雄传的发生故事时间应该适和读斗三同时发生，然后后面接着斗四来。",favbury:a,floor:a,user:{grade:a,nickname:"初梦靈",id:104372889,userTagList:[],pub_feed:a,avatar_url:ny,avatar_url_jpg:ny,reg_type:m,user_role:a,user_role_mark:a,vip_type:a,head_charm_id:a,head_charm_url:c,dynamic_head_charm_url:c,vip_icon:c,nameplate_id:a,nameplate_image:c,reward_honour_title:c,reward_extra:{reward_title_color:c,reward_bg_color:c}},source:a,best:b,liked:b,sticky:b,comicAuthor:b,likes_count_info:k,target_type:a,comic_id:g,comment_type:a,replied_comment_id:f,replied_user_id:a,likes_count:d,is_liked:b,is_comic_author:b,is_best:b,is_sticky:b,created_at:1550471291,created_at_info:"2019-02-18 14:28",content_type:d},{id:"719626528168704128",content:"　雨浩不是随戴沐白认祖归宗妀姓戴了么？为什么上面又写霍雨浩呢？￣o￣？",favbury:a,floor:d,user:{grade:a,nickname:"殘缺回忆",id:31514166,userTagList:[],pub_feed:a,avatar_url:nz,avatar_url_jpg:nz,reg_type:m,user_role:a,user_role_mark:a,vip_type:a,head_charm_id:a,head_charm_url:c,dynamic_head_charm_url:c,vip_icon:c,nameplate_id:a,nameplate_image:c,reward_honour_title:c,reward_extra:{reward_title_color:c,reward_bg_color:c}},source:a,best:b,liked:b,sticky:b,comicAuthor:b,likes_count_info:jt,target_type:a,comic_id:g,comment_type:a,replied_comment_id:f,replied_user_id:a,likes_count:ju,is_liked:b,is_comic_author:b,is_best:b,is_sticky:b,created_at:1550377275,created_at_info:"2019-02-17 12:21",content_type:d},{id:"800994851833346752",content:"三哥日常吃老本中……",favbury:a,floor:a,user:{grade:a,nickname:"楊翛亱",id:93932835,userTagList:[],pub_feed:a,avatar_url:nA,avatar_url_jpg:nA,reg_type:j,user_role:a,user_role_mark:a,vip_type:a,head_charm_id:a,head_charm_url:c,dynamic_head_charm_url:c,vip_icon